# What does not belong in the repository.
#
# The rule here is that a clone should be able to run the game, run the tests
# and build a binary. Anything a clone can regenerate, and anything private,
# stays out. Everything else goes in.

# Python bytecode.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# The virtual environment.
.garden/
.venv/
venv/

# Tool caches.
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Build output. Nuitka writes the working directories beside the project and
# leaves the finished binary in the project root; the Inno Setup compiler puts
# the Windows setup in dist/.
build/
dist/
*.build/
*.dist/
*.onefile-build/
/snakeee
/snakeee.exe

# Editors and operating systems.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs, if anybody runs the game from inside the checkout.
*.log
